Subject: [PATCH 4/4] test: support Python 3.8 feature matrix hosts

---
 test-app/README.md                   | 1 +
 test-app/requirements-dev.txt        | 1 +
 test-app/tools/check-slint-source.py | 5 ++++-
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 test-app/requirements-dev.txt

diff --git a/test-app/README.md b/test-app/README.md
index 750a926..1ebed2a 100644
--- a/test-app/README.md
+++ b/test-app/README.md
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@ test-app/
 ```
 
 以下命令从仓库根目录执行。根目录不加 package 选择时默认只检查适配库；使用 `-p slint-bridge-test-app`、`--manifest-path test-app/Cargo.toml` 或进入本目录可单独选择测试工程，使用 `--workspace` 检查两者。
+Python 3.10 及更早版本先执行 `python3 -m pip install --requirement test-app/requirements-dev.txt`；Python 3.11 及以上直接使用标准库 TOML 解析器。
 
 ## 从最小例子看接入方法
 
diff --git a/test-app/requirements-dev.txt b/test-app/requirements-dev.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..92f257d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test-app/requirements-dev.txt
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+tomli==2.5.0; python_version < "3.11"
diff --git a/test-app/tools/check-slint-source.py b/test-app/tools/check-slint-source.py
index c8235c4..4723060 100644
--- a/test-app/tools/check-slint-source.py
+++ b/test-app/tools/check-slint-source.py
@@ -1,7 +1,10 @@
 #!/usr/bin/env python3
 """Reject mixed or floating Slint source revisions in this workspace."""
 
-import tomllib
+try:
+    import tomllib
+except ModuleNotFoundError:  # Python 3.10 and older.
+    import tomli as tomllib
 from pathlib import Path
 
 
